*Picks 3 Bonus Stars at random at the start of every game (Party and Story Mode)
*from: Mini-Game, Coin, Happening, Item, Shopping, Running, Slow, Red, Bowser.
*The host announces them after the turn order and awards them at the end.
*Needs the bonus star text added to mess/board_e.dat (bank 56). MP4 DX only.
