*During the Last 5 Turns, landing on a space where another player stands
*steals up to 10 coins from them (all of them if they have fewer).
*The board host announces the rule at the end of the Last Five Turns Event.
*Skipped for a partner in Team Battle and when a Mega Mushroom or the Bowser Suit
*already crushed them. Needs mess/board_e.dat bank 57; without it the code does nothing.
